# UI Component Library — Untitled UI React

All frontend UI in `frontend/src/` must follow the **Untitled UI React** design system.

## Stack
- React 19 + Tailwind CSS 4 + TypeScript 5.9 + React Aria
- Components live in `frontend/src/components/ui/`

## Rules
- **Do NOT** create one-off custom UI primitives (buttons, badges, inputs, modals, tabs, selects) when an Untitled UI equivalent exists
- **Always check** `frontend/src/components/ui/` before adding a new component
- **Add new components** via: `npx untitledui@latest add <component_name>`
- Reference docs: https://www.untitledui.com/react

## Color Tokens (CSS variables in `frontend/src/index.css`)
- `--color-gold: #b8860b` — primary accent (buttons, active states, badges)
- `--color-gold-light: #d4a017` — hover state for gold
- `--bg: #f0f2f5` — page background
- `--bg2: #ffffff` — card/panel background
- `--bg3: #f6f8fa` — subtle background
- `--text: #1a1f2e` — primary text
- `--text-muted: #6b7280` — secondary text
- `--border: #e2e8f0` — border color
- `--green: #16a34a` — success / active
- `--red: #dc2626` — error / awaiting
- `--blue: #2563eb` — info / phase due
- `--orange: #d97706` — warning

## Badge Variants
- `gold` — awaiting draft / pending
- `red` — awaiting first program
- `blue` — new training phase due
- `green` — active / approved / actioned
- `grey` — inactive / neutral

## Naming Conventions
- Page components → `frontend/src/pages/`
- Layout shell → `frontend/src/components/layout/`
- Shared UI primitives → `frontend/src/components/ui/`
- Domain features → `frontend/src/features/`

## Theme
- **Light theme only** on this branch (dark theme is removed)
- Background: `bg-[var(--bg)]`, cards: `bg-[var(--bg2)]`
- Primary accent: `text-[var(--color-gold)]`, `bg-[var(--color-gold)]`
- Borders: `border-[var(--border)]`
